"description": "A stacked area chart: one coloured layer per series, stacked on a zero baseline over an ordered x axis (time, stages, categories), so the top edge is the total and each layer's thickness is that series' value. Drawn as SVG with a zero-based value axis, a legend and a hidden data table. The optional offset turns it into a 100% share chart (expand), a centred chart (silhouette) or a streamgraph (wiggle). Before 2026-10-21 the default was a list of horizontal bars; layout 'bars' still draws that.",
